000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     THOLDTRN.
000400 AUTHOR.         KURT MOVSESIAN.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.   SEPTEMBER 11,1987.
000600*REMARKS.
000700*
000800**************************************************************
000900**                                                          **
001000**   T H O L D T R N - ABSTRACTS ALL OF THE TRANSACTIONS    **
001100**   PLACED IN THE 'DHOLDTRN' DATA SET BECAUSE THE          **
001200**   TRANSACTION DATE WAS BEYOND THE MONTH-END CUTOFF DATE. **
001300**   THE TRANSACTIONS ARE PLACED IN AN MPE FILE TO BE       **
001400**   PROCESSED BY 'TDLYTRNS' AFTER THE MONTH-END CLOSING    **
001500**   IS COMPLETE FOR THE PREVIOUS MONTH.                    **
001600**                                                          **
001700**************************************************************
001800
      *C  17SEP1993          DAVE PLUM
      *C  ADDED LOGIC TO RESET THE NEW FIELD MACCT-FINCLS-SW TO SPACES
      *C  AT THE SAME TIME THE OTHER "MTED" FIELDS ARE RESET.
      *C  MACCT-FINCLS-SW IS SET TO "Y" IN PROGRAM TSTRMAVG AT THE TIME
      *C  THE BATCH JOB BXFINCLS IS STARTED.
      *C
      *C  14OCT1993          DAVE PLUM
      *C  ADDED LOGIC TO RESET THE FILED MACCT-RAWWOFF-SW TO SPACES AT
      *C  THE SAME TIME THE OTHER "MTED" FIELDS ARE RESET.  THIS FIELD
      *C  IS SET TO "X" WHENEVER PROGRAM TRAWWOFF IS EXECUTED WITH "YES"
      *C  AS THE VALUE PASSED THROUGH AN ACCEPT STATEMENT (JOB BBALWOFF,
      *C  VIA TSTRMBAL (SR20)).
      *C
      *C   28FEB1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C   09SEP1996   DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C     NOTE: THE DATE FIELD IN THE HOLDTRAN FILE WILL REMAIN AS
      *C           6 BYTE FIELD SO THAT THIS FILE REMAINS AN 80 BYTE
      *C           FILE WHICH MATCHES DDAILYTC/ABSTFILE.
      *C
      *C   11FEB1997   DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED PROGRAM TO HANDLE AN 8 CHARACTER DATE FOR THE
      *C     DHOLDTRAN DATASET (MCFPCA0900).  THIS FILE WAS UNEXPECTEDLY
      *C     MODIFIED FOR THE J.01 RELEASE.  THIS CHANGE IS A J.01 FIX.
      *C        - DHOLDTRAN (MCFPCA0900) HAS 82 BYTE RECORDS (8 BYTE DATE)
      *C        - HOLDTRAN  (DHLDTRN*)   HAS 80 BYTE RECORDS (6 BYTE DATE)
      *C
001900 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002000 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002100 SOURCE-COMPUTER.
002200 OBJECT-COMPUTER.
002300 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
002400 FILE-CONTROL.
002500     SELECT HOLDTRAN-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-DHLDTRN.

           SELECT MACTINFO-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DHOLDTRAN-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

002700 DATA DIVISION.
002800 FILE SECTION.
002900 FD  HOLDTRAN-FILE
003000     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
003100     RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS
003200     DATA RECORD IS HOLDTRAN-REC.
003300 01  HOLDTRAN-REC.
003400     05  HOLDTRAN-DATE            PIC X(6).
003500     05  HOLDTRAN-TIME            PIC X(6).
003600     05  HOLDTRAN-DATA            PIC X(68).

       FD  MACTINFO-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MACTINFO-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCA0101.

       FD  DHOLDTRAN-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DHOLDTRAN-O-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCA0901.

003800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
003900 77  EOF-SW                       PIC X   VALUE SPACES.
004000 77  RCD-COUNTER                  PIC S9(6) COMP-4 VALUE ZEROS.
       77  MCXCBLERR-SCOPE              PIC X(1)  VALUE "C".

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X     VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X     VALUE SPACES.
004100
004200 01  MDY-DATE.
004300     05  MM-IN                    PIC XX.
004400     05  FILLER                   PIC X.
004500     05  DD-IN                    PIC XX.
004600     05  FILLER                   PIC X.
004700     05  YY-IN                    PIC XX.
004800
004900 01  YMD-DATE.
005000     05  YY-IN                    PIC XX.
005100     05  MM-IN                    PIC XX.
005200     05  DD-IN                    PIC XX.
005300
       01  TIME-OF-DAY                  PIC X(6).

      ****** THE DATE FIELD WILL REMAIN 6 BYTES IN LENGTH TO MATCH
      ****** THE DDAILYTC/ABSTFILE FORMAT (09SEP1996 DAVE PLUM)
005400 01  HEADER-TRAILER-TC.
005500     05  DAILY-TC-DATE            PIC X(6)  VALUE SPACES.
005600     05  DAILY-TC-TIME            PIC X(6)  VALUE SPACES.
005700     05  DAILY-TC-TC              PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
005800     05  DAILY-TC-PLT             PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
005900     05  DAILY-TC-CNTR            PIC 9(6)  VALUE ZEROS.
006000     05  DAILY-TC-SEQ             PIC 9(5)  VALUE ZEROS.
006100
006200**************************************************************
006300**
006400**        DATABASE I/O WORK AREA
006500**
006600**************************************************************
006700
006800 COPY DHOLDTRN IN COPYLIB.
006900
007000 COPY MACTINFO IN COPYLIB.
007100
007200 COPY DATAB IN COPYLIB.
007300
007400 COPY DBCSACCT IN COPYLIB.
007500
007600*********************
007700*                   *
007800*   DATA SET NAMES  *
007900*                   *
008000*********************
008100
008200 01  DSET-NAMES.
008300     05  DSET-NAME            PIC X(16)  VALUE SPACES.
008400     05  DSET-DHOLDTRAN       PIC X(16)  VALUE "DHOLDTRAN;".
008500     05  DSET-MACCT           PIC X(16)  VALUE "MACCOUNT-INFO;".
008600
008700 01 ITEMS-LISTING.
008800     05  ALL-ITEMS            PIC XX    VALUE "@;".
008900
009000 01 ARG-VALUES.
009100     05  DUMMY-ARG            PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
009200     05  MACCT-KEY            PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
009300
009500 COPY MULTLOCK IN COPYLIB.
009600
009700 COPY TBLOWUP IN COPYLIB.

010000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
010100 0-BEGIN SECTION 01.
       0-BEGIN-HERE.
010200     PERFORM  1-HSK  THRU  1-HSK-X.
010300
010400     PERFORM  6-MAIN  THRU  6-MAIN-X.
010500
010600     PERFORM  2-CLOSE-FILES  THRU  2-CLOSE-FILES-X.
010700
010800     GOBACK.
010900
011100 1-HSK.
           MOVE "C" TO MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.
           CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.

           OPEN I-O MACTINFO-O, DHOLDTRAN-O.
011900
012000 1-HSK-X.
012100     EXIT.
012200
012400 2-CLOSE-FILES.
           CLOSE MACTINFO-O, DHOLDTRAN-O.
013200
013300 2-CLOSE-FILES-X.
013400     EXIT.
013500
013700******************************************************
013800**                                                  **
013900**   BLOWUP ROUTINE                                 **
014000**                                                  **
014100******************************************************
014200
014300 2-BLOWUP.
014400     MOVE "THOLDTRN"              TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
014500     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING ACCTG-BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
014600         DUMMY-VIEW-AREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
014700             BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
014800
015100 6-MAIN.
015200     PERFORM 61-PROCESS-DHOLDTRN  THRU  61-PD-X.
015300
015400 6-MAIN-X.
015500     EXIT.
015600
015800 61-PROCESS-DHOLDTRN.
017200     OPEN OUTPUT HOLDTRAN-FILE.
017300
017400******************************************
017500**   BUILD HEADER TC '001'
017600******************************************
017700
017800     MOVE "PLT"                   TO  MACCT-KEY.
           MOVE MACCT-KEY TO INFOKEY OF MACTINFO-REC-O.
           READ MACTINFO-O INTO BUF-MACCT-INFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
018200         MOVE "DBGET MACCT 'PLT'* 61-PD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
018300         MOVE MACCT-KEY           TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
018400         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO INFOKEY OF MACTINFO-REC-O.
           START MACTINFO-O KEY > INFOKEY OF MACTINFO-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.
018500
018600*    MOVE CURRENT-DATE            TO  MDY-DATE.
018700*    MOVE CORR MDY-DATE           TO  YMD-DATE.
      ****** THE DATE FIELD WILL REMAIN 6 BYTES IN LENGTH TO MATCH
      ****** THE DDAILYTC/ABSTFILE FORMAT (09SEP1996 DAVE PLUM)
           ACCEPT YMD-DATE      FROM DATE.
           ACCEPT TIME-OF-DAY   FROM TIME.
018800     MOVE SPACES                  TO  HEADER-TRAILER-TC.
018900     MOVE YMD-DATE                TO  DAILY-TC-DATE.
019000     MOVE TIME-OF-DAY             TO  DAILY-TC-TIME.
019100     MOVE "001"                   TO  DAILY-TC-TC.
019200     MOVE MACCT-PLT-CODE          TO  DAILY-TC-PLT.
019300     MOVE 99999                   TO  DAILY-TC-SEQ.
019400     MOVE HEADER-TRAILER-TC       TO  HOLDTRAN-REC.
019500     WRITE HOLDTRAN-REC.
019600     MOVE 1                       TO  RCD-COUNTER.
019700
019800     MOVE SPACES                  TO  EOF-SW.
019900     PERFORM 611-WRITE-DHOLDTRAN-FILE THRU 611-WDF-X
020000         UNTIL EOF-SW = "Y".
020100
020200******************************************
020300**   BUILD TRAILER TC '900'
020400******************************************
020500
020600     MOVE "900"                   TO  DAILY-TC-TC.
020700     ADD  1                       TO  RCD-COUNTER.
020800     MOVE RCD-COUNTER             TO  DAILY-TC-CNTR.
020900     MOVE HEADER-TRAILER-TC       TO  HOLDTRAN-REC.
021000     WRITE HOLDTRAN-REC.
021100
021200     CLOSE HOLDTRAN-FILE.
021300     DISPLAY "** DHOLD-TRAN FILE CLOSED **".
022100     MOVE SPACES                  TO  EOF-SW.
021400
           READ DHOLDTRAN-O FIRST INTO BUF-DHOLDTRAN
               AT END MOVE "Y" TO EOF-SW.
022000
022200     PERFORM 612-DELETE-DHOLDTRAN-FILE  THRU  612-DDF-X
022300         UNTIL EOF-SW = "Y".
022400     DISPLAY "** DHOLD-TRAN DATA SET ENTRIES DELETED **".
022500
022600*******************************************************
022700**                                                   **
022800**   RESET THE ENTRY 'MTED' OF MACCOUNT-INFO FOR A   **
022900**   NEW MONTH.  THE NEW MONTH END CUTOFF DATE IS    **
023000**   ACTIVATED AND LAST CUTOFF TC AND MANIFEST NO.   **
023100**   PROCESSED ARE RESET TO SPACES FOR THE NEW       **
023200**   MONTH                                           **
023300**                                                   **
023400*******************************************************
023500
023600 61-UPDATE-MACCOUNT-INFO.
023700     MOVE "MTED"                  TO  MACCT-KEY.
           MOVE MACCT-KEY TO INFOKEY OF MACTINFO-REC-O.
           READ MACTINFO-O INTO BUF-MACCT-INFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
024100         MOVE "DBGET MACCT 'MTED'* 61-UMI" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
024200         MOVE MACCT-KEY           TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
024300         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
024400
024500     MOVE MACCT-MONTH-END-DATE    TO  MACCT-PREV-MTH-END-DATE.
024600     MOVE MACCT-MONTH-END-TIME    TO  MACCT-PREV-MTH-END-TIME.
024700     MOVE MACCT-NEXT-MTH-END-DATE TO  MACCT-MONTH-END-DATE.
024800     MOVE MACCT-NEXT-MTH-END-TIME TO  MACCT-MONTH-END-TIME.
024900     MOVE SPACES                  TO  MACCT-LATEST-CUTOFF-DATE,
025000                                      MACCT-LATEST-CUTOFF-TIME,
025100                                      MACCT-LAST-MANIFEST,
025200                                      MACCT-AVG-COST-CALC-SW,
025300                                      MACCT-VOUCHER-SENT-SW,
025400                                      MACCT-BALWOFF-SW,
025500                                      MACCT-LIFORPT-SW
                                            MACCT-RAWWOFF-SW
                                            MACCT-FINCLS-SW.
           REWRITE MACTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MACCT-INFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
025900         MOVE "UPDATE MACCT-INFO * 61-UMI" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
026000         MOVE MACCT-KEY           TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
026100         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
026900
027000 61-PD-X.
027100     EXIT.
027200
027300
027400 611-WRITE-DHOLDTRAN-FILE.
027500**************************************************************
027600*     I DO A SERIAL READ (MODE2) ON THE DHOLDTRN DATASET     *
027700**************************************************************
      ****** 09SEP1996 THE DHOLDTRAN BUFFER NOW INCLUDES AN 8 BYTE
      ******  DATE FIELD FOR RELEASE J.01 WHILE THE HOLDTRAN RECORD
      ******  WILL RETAIN A 6 BYTE DATE FIELD.  WE CAN NO LONGER
      ******  SIMPLY MOVE THE ENTIRE DHOLDTRAN BUFFER (BUF-DHOLDTRAN)
      ******  TO THE HOLDTRAN-REC.  WE MUST NOW MOVE SEVERAL
      ******  INDIVIDUAL FIELDS.    ---DAVE PLUM
      ****** 10FEB1997 SINCE BUF-DHOLDTRAN DID END UP WITH AN 8 BYTE
      ******  DATE FIELD FOR J.01, THE ABOVE INFORMATION IS CORRECT
      ******  AND THE LOGIC LISTED BELOW WILL WORK.  WE ARE MOVING
      ******  DATA FROM THE 82 BYTE (8 BYTE DATE FIELD) DHOLDTRAN
      ******  FILE TO THE 80 BYTE (6 BYTE DATE FIELD) HOLDTRAN FILE.

           READ DHOLDTRAN-O NEXT INTO BUF-DHOLDTRAN
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE "Y" TO EOF-SW
               ELSE
028400             MOVE "GET DHOLDTRN*611-WDF" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
028500             GO TO 2-BLOWUP
028600     ELSE
028700         ADD 1                    TO  RCD-COUNTER
028800*********MOVE BUF-DHOLDTRAN       TO  HOLDTRAN-REC
      ************ MOVE THE 6 BYTE DATE FIELD TO THE OUTPUT RECORD
               MOVE DHOLDTRAN-DATE      TO  HOLDTRAN-DATE
               MOVE DHOLDTRAN-TIME      TO  HOLDTRAN-TIME
               MOVE DHOLDTRAN-DATA      TO  HOLDTRAN-DATA
028900         WRITE HOLDTRAN-REC.
029000
029100 611-WDF-X.
029200     EXIT.
029300
029400
029500 612-DELETE-DHOLDTRAN-FILE.
           DELETE DHOLDTRAN-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
031100         MOVE "DELETE DHOLDTRAN * 612-DDF" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
031200         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

029600**************************************************************
029700*     I DO A SERIAL READ (MODE2) ON THE DHOLDTRN DATASET     *
029800**************************************************************
           READ DHOLDTRAN-O NEXT INTO BUF-DHOLDTRAN
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE "Y" TO EOF-SW
               ELSE
030500             MOVE "GET DHOLDTRN*612-DDF" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
030600             GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
031300
031400 612-DDF-X.
031500     EXIT.
